usage: train.py [-h]
                {control-block,control-reload,probe,smoke,train,reload-check,plot}
                ...

Bounded, single-environment SB3 PPO experiments on the frozen X2 environment.
Instrumentation observes SB3's own rollouts and optimizer. It never changes
the buffer, reward, actions, gradients, reset semantics or physical
environment.

positional arguments:
  {control-block,control-reload,probe,smoke,train,reload-check,plot}
    control-block       Bounded PPO on an explicitly versioned learning
                        controller
    control-reload      One complete deterministic development attempt in this
                        process

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
